The three programs in this directory are of a rather unfinished nature, and should not be used by the casual user.

CleanCopy     This makes a fresh copy of a StrongHelp manual, withouth the
              internal fragmentation that builds up over time. This will
              eventually surface in a dialogue box, but for the time being
              one must edit the program before running it.

Extract       If you should happen to have designed anything for the old
              StrongHelp, then you can use this program to convert to the
              new format. The conversion is far from complete, but it
              sufficed for my purpose, and I will not develop it further